OL,6, The Labour Party has published its
OL,7, election manifesto under the slogan
OL,8, "The Labour way is the better way".
OL,10,FThe manifesto halldred out by the
OL,11,FPrime Minister, the Cabinet and the
OL,12,FNational Executive is a generally
OL,13,Fmoderate package envisaging tax reform,
OL,14,Fno sweeping nationalisation and annual
OL,15,Feconomic growth of 3% or more.
OL,17,FLabour plans to fight on to reduce the
OL,18,Frate of inflation. Old age pensions and
OL,19,Fchild benefits are to rise. There are
OL,20,Fplans to reduce unemployment and
OL,21,Fprovide equal educational opportunities
OL,22,C
OL,23,  FFromG06-04-79F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
