OL,4,W-,,%-,,%-,,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,$
OL,7, Pay talks between leaders of the civil
OL,8, service unions and the government have
OL,9, broken up after five hours without
OL,10, agreement.
OL,12,FA joint statement said the talks had
OL,13,Fbeen adjourned but no date was given
OL,14,Ffor their resumption.
OL,16,FThe eight unions at the meeting were
OL,17,Fpressing for increases above the
OL,18,Fgovernment's "final" offer of nine
OL,19,Fpercent, with further staged rises.
OL,21,FIn particular, the unions want help
OL,22,Ffor the lower paid.
OL,23,                        FFromG06-04-79
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
