OL,3,VW  jupjuz5  jupjupV
OL,4,S
OL,6,FPRINCESS MICHAEL OF KENTGgave birth to
OL,7, a seven-pound boy in Paddington
OL,8, Hospital at 7.25 this morning.
OL,10,FPrince Michael was present and the
OL,11,FQueen was informed immediately of the
OL,12,Fbirth. A Buckingham Palace spokesman
OL,13,Fsaid mother and son were both in good
OL,14,Fspirits.
OL,16,FThe former Austrian Baroness Marie-
OL,17,FChristine von Riebnitz, who is 33, and
OL,18,FPrince Michael were married last June.
OL,19,FThe Pope refused to allow her a church
OL,20,Fwedding, because Prince Michael wanted
OL,21,Fthe children brought up as Anglicans,
OL,22,Fto which the Princess has agreed.
OL,23,                        FFromG06-04-79
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
