OL,7, Latest reports from Uganda suggest that
OL,8, the invading force of Tanzanian troops
OL,9, and Ugandan exiles may take control of
OL,10, the capital Kampala in a matter of
OL,11, hours.
OL,13,BPresident Amin was heard on Uganda
OL,14,BRadio this afternoon making an apparent
OL,15,Blast-ditch appeal to his soldiers to
OL,16,Bremain loyal.
OL,18,BLater, a report from the Tanzanian
OL,19,Bcapital Dar-es-Salaam said that the
OL,20,BUgandan National Liberation Front had
OL,21,Bissued a communique claiming their
OL,22,Bforces had occupied Kampala.
OL,23,                        BFromG06-04-79
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
