OL,4,W-,,%-,,%-,,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,$
OL,7, There have been more violent protests
OL,8, in Pakistan over the execution of the
OL,9, former Prime Minister, Mr Bhutto.
OL,11,FSeveral people were hurt in a second
OL,12,Fday of rioting in Karachi. In Kashmir,
OL,13,FIndia, two people died following
OL,14,Fdemonstrations over the death of the
OL,15,Fformer Pakistani Premier.
OL,23,C                       FFromG06-04-79
