OL,7,S/GPetrol pricesFare to go up at the
OL,8,Fpumps from tomorrow. Shell says it
OL,9,Fis joining Esso and BP in raising
OL,10,Fprices. Shell four star is likely to
OL,11,Fcost 3\p more per gallon.   B
OL,13,S/GThe Chrysler Car CompanyFsays the
OL,14,Fdispute at its Linwood plant in
OL,15,FRenfrewshire could cost the firm
OL,16,Fmillions in lost production if there
OL,17,Fis no quick settlement. Some 7OO
OL,18,Fworkers are on unofficial strike over
OL,19,Fthe suspension of one man, and another
OL,20,F3,OOO have been laid off.
OL,23,C                      FFromG06-04-79
